<title>USA: Medwave to begin shipping Vasotrac system.</title>
<headline>Medwave to begin shipping Vasotrac system.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medwave Inc said it expects to begin limited product delivery during its second quarter ending October 31 of its Vasotrac blood pressure monitoring sytstem.</p>
<p>The company began a controlled market rollout of Vasotrac in August.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
